# Build context exclusions for both apps/api and apps/worker images.
# Without these, the worker build pulls in 1.5GB+ from apps/api/.venv
# (symlinks to /usr/bin/python3 which docker buildkit rejects).

**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/

# Web build artifacts that don't belong in api/worker images
apps/web/node_modules/
apps/web/.next/
apps/web/out/

# Local ad-hoc files
docker-compose.override.yml
.env
.env.local
.git/
.github/

# Saved models — bundle separately when training pipeline matures
apps/api/ml/saved_models/*.pkl
apps/api/ml/saved_models/*.pt
# Equity ensemble pulled 2026-06-10: the train gate measured it edgeless
# (val_acc 0.348 < majority 0.377, train_acc 0.90 = overfit). Equity trades the
# technical-only blend until a model passes the gate; re-add the allow line
# (equity_ensemble_*.pkl) when one does.
# Re-include the crypto RankingModel artifact (1.6). train_ranking.py writes
# crypto_ranking_v1.0.pkl; the legacy registry fallback name is ranking_v1.0.pkl.
# Without these allows the worker image ships without the crypto model and the
# registry silently falls back to _heuristic_predict.
!apps/api/ml/saved_models/crypto_ranking_v1.0.pkl
!apps/api/ml/saved_models/ranking_v1.0.pkl
# Crypto meta-labeler (P(win) gate over the combiner side). Image-baked because
# Fly machines have no durable volume — an out-of-band copy into MODEL_DIR
# would vanish on every restart/redeploy. Dormant until crypto joins
# WORKER_ASSET_CLASSES; resolve_meta() loads it by this exact name.
!apps/api/ml/saved_models/crypto_meta_v1.0.pkl
